{"seq":1,"slug":"retrofit-and-okhttp","title":"Retrofit 与 OkHttp","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/retrofit-and-okhttp","wordCount":644,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"retrofit-与-okhttp\">Retrofit 与 OkHttp</h1><p>Retrofit 是 Android 最流行的类型安全 HTTP 客户端，建立在 OkHttp 之上。Retrofit 通过接口声明 API 端点，OkHttp 提供底层的 HTTP 通信、连接池、缓存和拦截器等能力。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这套网络栈围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>接口即 API</strong>：Retrofit 用注解（<code>@GET</code> / <code>@Path</code> / <code>@Query</code> / <code>@Body</code> 等）在接口上声明端点，编译期生成实现，调用方得到类型安全的 <code>suspend</code> 函数。</li>\n<li><strong>转换器（Converter）</strong>：负责请求/响应体的序列化，Kotlin Serialization 因编译时生成、性能好而成为推荐选择。</li>\n<li><strong>拦截器（Interceptor）</strong>：在请求/响应链路上插入横切逻辑（鉴权、日志、重试）；应用拦截器在缓存之前，网络拦截器在缓存之后，用于缓存头修改。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存与安全</strong>：内置 HTTP 缓存遵循 <code>Cache-Control</code>，支持离线访问；Certificate Pinning 固定服务器证书公钥防中间人攻击，需固定至少两个哈希以应对轮换。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"api-接口\">API 接口</h2><p>Retrofit 使用注解标记接口方法，定义 HTTP 请求的 URL、方法和参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface ArticleApi {&#10;&#10;    @GET(&quot;articles&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun getArticles(&#10;        @Query(&quot;page&quot;) page: Int = 1,&#10;        @Query(&quot;size&quot;) size: Int = 20,&#10;        @Query(&quot;category&quot;) category: String? = null&#10;    ): ApiResponse&lt;List&lt;ArticleDto&gt;&gt;&#10;&#10;    @GET(&quot;articles/{id}&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun getArticleById(@Path(&quot;id&quot;) id: String): ApiResponse&lt;ArticleDto&gt;&#10;&#10;    @POST(&quot;articles&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun createArticle(@Body request: CreateArticleRequest): ApiResponse&lt;ArticleDto&gt;&#10;&#10;    @PUT(&quot;articles/{id}&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun updateArticle(&#10;        @Path(&quot;id&quot;) id: String,&#10;        @Body request: UpdateArticleRequest&#10;    ): ApiResponse&lt;ArticleDto&gt;&#10;&#10;    @DELETE(&quot;articles/{id}&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun deleteArticle(@Path(&quot;id&quot;) id: String): ApiResponse&lt;Unit&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Multipart&#10;    @POST(&quot;articles/{id}/images&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun uploadImage(&#10;        @Path(&quot;id&quot;) id: String,&#10;        @Part image: MultipartBody.Part&#10;    ): ApiResponse&lt;ImageUrl&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Streaming&#10;    @GET(&quot;files/{name}&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun downloadFile(@Path(&quot;name&quot;) fileName: String): ResponseBody&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class ApiResponse&lt;T&gt;(&#10;    val code: Int,&#10;    val message: String,&#10;    val data: T?&#10;)&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class ArticleDto(&#10;    val id: String,&#10;    val title: String,&#10;    val content: String,&#10;    val author: AuthorDto,&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;created_at&quot;) val createdAt: String&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface ArticleApi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @GET(\"articles\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getArticles(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Query(\"page\") page: Int = 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Query(\"size\") size: Int = 20,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Query(\"category\") category: String? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): ApiResponse&#x3C;List&#x3C;ArticleDto>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @GET(\"articles/{id}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getArticleById(@Path(\"id\") id: String): ApiResponse&#x3C;ArticleDto></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @POST(\"articles\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun createArticle(@Body request: CreateArticleRequest): ApiResponse&#x3C;ArticleDto></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @PUT(\"articles/{id}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun updateArticle(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Path(\"id\") id: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Body request: UpdateArticleRequest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): ApiResponse&#x3C;ArticleDto></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @DELETE(\"articles/{id}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun deleteArticle(@Path(\"id\") id: String): ApiResponse&#x3C;Unit></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Multipart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @POST(\"articles/{id}/images\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun uploadImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Path(\"id\") id: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @Part image: MultipartBody.Part</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): ApiResponse&#x3C;ImageUrl></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Streaming</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @GET(\"files/{name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun downloadFile(@Path(\"name\") fileName: String): ResponseBody</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ApiResponse&#x3C;T>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val code: Int,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val message: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val data: T?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ArticleDto(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val id: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val title: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val content: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val author: AuthorDto,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"created_at\") val createdAt: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用注解对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注解</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@GET</code> / <code>@POST</code> / <code>@PUT</code> / <code>@DELETE</code></td>\n<td>HTTP 方法</td>\n<td>方法上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Path</code></td>\n<td>URL 路径参数</td>\n<td>参数上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Query</code></td>\n<td>URL 查询参数</td>\n<td>参数上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Body</code></td>\n<td>请求体</td>\n<td>参数上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Header</code></td>\n<td>单个请求头</td>\n<td>参数上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Headers</code></td>\n<td>固定请求头</td>\n<td>方法上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Multipart</code> / <code>@Part</code></td>\n<td>文件上传</td>\n<td>方法/参数上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Streaming</code></td>\n<td>流式下载</td>\n<td>方法上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"转换器\">转换器</h2><p>Converter 负责请求体和响应体的序列化与反序列化。推荐使用 Kotlin Serialization。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object NetworkModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideJson(): Json = Json {&#10;        ignoreUnknownKeys = true&#10;        coerceInputValues = true&#10;        encodeDefaults = true&#10;        isLenient = true&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideRetrofit(&#10;        okHttpClient: OkHttpClient,&#10;        json: Json&#10;    ): Retrofit {&#10;        return Retrofit.Builder()&#10;            .baseUrl(&quot;https://api.example.com/v1/&quot;)&#10;            .client(okHttpClient)&#10;            .addConverterFactory(json.asConverterFactory(&quot;application/json&quot;.toMediaType()))&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object NetworkModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideJson(): Json = Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ignoreUnknownKeys = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coerceInputValues = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        encodeDefaults = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isLenient = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideRetrofit(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        okHttpClient: OkHttpClient,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        json: Json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): Retrofit {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Retrofit.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .baseUrl(\"https://api.example.com/v1/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .client(okHttpClient)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addConverterFactory(json.asConverterFactory(\"application/json\".toMediaType()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转换器</th>\n<th>依赖</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kotlin Serialization</td>\n<td><code>retrofit2-kotlinx-serialization-converter</code></td>\n<td>编译时生成，性能好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Moshi</td>\n<td><code>converter-moshi</code></td>\n<td>轻量，Kotlin 友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gson</td>\n<td><code>converter-gson</code></td>\n<td>历史最广泛，反射开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"拦截器\">拦截器</h2><p>OkHttp 拦截器可以在请求和响应的链路中插入自定义逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class AuthInterceptor @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val tokenStore: TokenStore&#10;) : Interceptor {&#10;&#10;    override fun intercept(chain: Interceptor.Chain): Response {&#10;        val token = tokenStore.getAccessToken()&#10;        val request = chain.request().newBuilder().apply {&#10;            if (token != null) {&#10;                addHeader(&quot;Authorization&quot;, &quot;Bearer $token&quot;)&#10;            }&#10;            addHeader(&quot;Accept-Language&quot;, Locale.getDefault().language)&#10;        }.build()&#10;        return chain.proceed(request)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class TokenRefreshInterceptor @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val tokenStore: TokenStore,&#10;    private val authApi: Lazy&lt;AuthApi&gt;&#10;) : Interceptor {&#10;&#10;    override fun intercept(chain: Interceptor.Chain): Response {&#10;        val response = chain.proceed(chain.request())&#10;&#10;        if (response.code == 401) {&#10;            synchronized(this) {&#10;                val newToken = runBlocking {&#10;                    authApi.get().refreshToken(tokenStore.getRefreshToken()!!)&#10;                }&#10;                tokenStore.saveToken(newToken)&#10;&#10;                val newRequest = chain.request().newBuilder()&#10;                    .header(&quot;Authorization&quot;, &quot;Bearer ${newToken.accessToken}&quot;)&#10;                    .build()&#10;                response.close()&#10;                return chain.proceed(newRequest)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return response&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Provides&#10;@Singleton&#10;fun provideOkHttpClient(&#10;    authInterceptor: AuthInterceptor,&#10;    tokenRefreshInterceptor: TokenRefreshInterceptor&#10;): OkHttpClient {&#10;    return OkHttpClient.Builder()&#10;        .addInterceptor(authInterceptor)&#10;        .addInterceptor(tokenRefreshInterceptor)&#10;        .addInterceptor(HttpLoggingInterceptor().apply {&#10;            level = if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.BODY&#10;                else HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.NONE&#10;        })&#10;        .connectTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)&#10;        .readTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)&#10;        .writeTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)&#10;        .build()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class AuthInterceptor @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val tokenStore: TokenStore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : Interceptor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun intercept(chain: Interceptor.Chain): Response {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val token = tokenStore.getAccessToken()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val request = chain.request().newBuilder().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (token != null) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                addHeader(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer $token\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            addHeader(\"Accept-Language\", Locale.getDefault().language)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }.build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return chain.proceed(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class TokenRefreshInterceptor @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val tokenStore: TokenStore,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val authApi: Lazy&#x3C;AuthApi></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : Interceptor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun intercept(chain: Interceptor.Chain): Response {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val response = chain.proceed(chain.request())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (response.code == 401) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            synchronized(this) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val newToken = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    authApi.get().refreshToken(tokenStore.getRefreshToken()!!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                tokenStore.saveToken(newToken)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val newRequest = chain.request().newBuilder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .header(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer ${newToken.accessToken}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                response.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return chain.proceed(newRequest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return response</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun provideOkHttpClient(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    authInterceptor: AuthInterceptor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokenRefreshInterceptor: TokenRefreshInterceptor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>): OkHttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return OkHttpClient.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addInterceptor(authInterceptor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addInterceptor(tokenRefreshInterceptor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addInterceptor(HttpLoggingInterceptor().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            level = if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.BODY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.NONE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .connectTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .readTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .writeTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App&#10;    participant AuthInterceptor&#10;    participant LoggingInterceptor&#10;    participant 服务器&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;AuthInterceptor: 发送请求&#10;    AuthInterceptor-&gt;&gt;AuthInterceptor: 添加 Token Header&#10;    AuthInterceptor-&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: 传递请求&#10;    LoggingInterceptor-&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: 记录请求日志&#10;    LoggingInterceptor-&gt;&gt;服务器: HTTP 请求&#10;    服务器--&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: HTTP 响应&#10;    LoggingInterceptor-&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: 记录响应日志&#10;    LoggingInterceptor--&gt;&gt;AuthInterceptor: 返回响应&#10;    AuthInterceptor--&gt;&gt;App: 返回响应\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App\n    participant AuthInterceptor\n    participant LoggingInterceptor\n    participant 服务器\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;AuthInterceptor: 发送请求\n    AuthInterceptor-&gt;&gt;AuthInterceptor: 添加 Token Header\n    AuthInterceptor-&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: 传递请求\n    LoggingInterceptor-&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: 记录请求日志\n    LoggingInterceptor-&gt;&gt;服务器: HTTP 请求\n    服务器--&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: HTTP 响应\n    LoggingInterceptor-&gt;&gt;LoggingInterceptor: 记录响应日志\n    LoggingInterceptor--&gt;&gt;AuthInterceptor: 返回响应\n    AuthInterceptor--&gt;&gt;App: 返回响应</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存\">缓存</h2><p>OkHttp 内置 HTTP 缓存支持，遵循 <code>Cache-Control</code> 头标准。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Provides&#10;@Singleton&#10;fun provideOkHttpClient(@ApplicationContext context: Context): OkHttpClient {&#10;    val cacheDir = File(context.cacheDir, &quot;http_cache&quot;)&#10;    val cache = Cache(cacheDir, 50L * 1024 * 1024) // 50 MB&#10;&#10;    return OkHttpClient.Builder()&#10;        .cache(cache)&#10;        .addNetworkInterceptor { chain -&gt;&#10;            val response = chain.proceed(chain.request())&#10;            response.newBuilder()&#10;                .header(&quot;Cache-Control&quot;, &quot;public, max-age=300&quot;)&#10;                .removeHeader(&quot;Pragma&quot;)&#10;                .build()&#10;        }&#10;        .addInterceptor { chain -&gt;&#10;            val request = if (!isNetworkAvailable(context)) {&#10;                chain.request().newBuilder()&#10;                    .header(&quot;Cache-Control&quot;, &quot;public, only-if-cached, max-stale=604800&quot;)&#10;                    .build()&#10;            } else {&#10;                chain.request()&#10;            }&#10;            chain.proceed(request)&#10;        }&#10;        .build()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun provideOkHttpClient(@ApplicationContext context: Context): OkHttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cacheDir = File(context.cacheDir, \"http_cache\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cache = Cache(cacheDir, 50L * 1024 * 1024) // 50 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return OkHttpClient.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .cache(cache)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addNetworkInterceptor { chain -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val response = chain.proceed(chain.request())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            response.newBuilder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .header(\"Cache-Control\", \"public, max-age=300\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .removeHeader(\"Pragma\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .addInterceptor { chain -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val request = if (!isNetworkAvailable(context)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                chain.request().newBuilder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .header(\"Cache-Control\", \"public, only-if-cached, max-stale=604800\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                chain.request()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            chain.proceed(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拦截器类型</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>执行位置</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用拦截器</td>\n<td><code>addInterceptor()</code></td>\n<td>缓存之前</td>\n<td>Auth、日志、重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络拦截器</td>\n<td><code>addNetworkInterceptor()</code></td>\n<td>缓存之后</td>\n<td>缓存头修改、压缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"证书固定\">证书固定</h2><p>Certificate Pinning 防止中间人攻击，固定服务器证书的公钥哈希。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Provides&#10;@Singleton&#10;fun provideSecureOkHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {&#10;    val certificatePinner = CertificatePinner.Builder()&#10;        .add(&quot;api.example.com&quot;, &quot;sha256/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=&quot;)&#10;        .add(&quot;api.example.com&quot;, &quot;sha256/BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB=&quot;)&#10;        .build()&#10;&#10;    return OkHttpClient.Builder()&#10;        .certificatePinner(certificatePinner)&#10;        .build()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun provideSecureOkHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val certificatePinner = CertificatePinner.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .add(\"api.example.com\", \"sha256/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .add(\"api.example.com\", \"sha256/BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB=\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return OkHttpClient.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .certificatePinner(certificatePinner)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 始终固定至少两个证书哈希（当前证书和备份证书），避免证书轮换时应用无法连接。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Retrofit 通过接口注解声明 API，支持 GET/POST/PUT/DELETE 等 HTTP 方法</li>\n<li>Kotlin Serialization 是推荐的转换器，提供编译时序列化性能</li>\n<li>OkHttp 拦截器实现鉴权、日志、缓存控制等横切关注点</li>\n<li>内置缓存支持离线访问，缓存策略遵循 HTTP Cache-Control 标准</li>\n<li>Certificate Pinning 固定服务器证书防止中间人攻击</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Retrofit 与 OkHttp","id":"retrofit-与-okhttp"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"API 接口","id":"api-接口"},{"level":2,"text":"转换器","id":"转换器"},{"level":2,"text":"拦截器","id":"拦截器"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存","id":"缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"证书固定","id":"证书固定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Koin 替代方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/koin-alternative"},"next":{"title":"Android 协程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/coroutines-in-android"}}